+ * capped at 20 dollars per transaction."
+ *
+ * Two cases:
+ *   A) Large order: uncapped fee > $20 → platform receives exactly $20,
+ *      merchant receives amount − $20.
+ *   B) Small order: uncapped fee < $20 → platform receives amount × 1.5%
+ *      (cap has no effect).
